<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">ALTAR OF FANGS · MYTHIC+ · SUBTLETY ROGUE</div>
    <h1><span class="cls">潜行者</span><span class="dot">·</span>毒牙祭坛 应对手册</h1>
    <p class="lede">毒牙祭坛几乎全是<b>自然伤害和持续毒</b>。<b>暗影斗篷</b>两分钟一次，整场按固定毒机制预留；其余范围和物理伤害靠<b>佯攻</b>兜住。唯一例外在祖尔加：仪式毒液斗篷清不掉，要开<b>佯攻</b>（闪避转好就叠）站进切骨者飞斧路径，靠流血把它冲掉。</p>
    <div class="chips">
      <span class="chip">参考 <b>+24 / +23 限时敏锐贼（国 / 欧 / 美）</b></span>
      <span class="chip">英雄天赋 <b>欺诈者</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="nav" aria-label="阶段导航">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="nav-scroll">
      <a href="#prep" class="on">速记</a>
      <a href="#timeline">时间轴</a>
      <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a href="#s1">开场</a>
      <a href="#s2"><span class="n">①</span>拉维</a>
      <a href="#s3">进化者</a>
      <a href="#s4"><span class="n">②</span>盘蛇</a>
      <a href="#s5">神选者</a>
      <a href="#s6"><span class="n">③</span>祖尔加</a>
      <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a href="#talent">天赋</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="wrap">

<section id="prep">
  <h2><span class="k">00</span>开打前速记</h2>
  <p class="sub">四张手牌管住全本，外加一条硬限制和两个必断读条。</p>

  <div class="cores">
    <article class="core main">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:31224}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">暗影斗篷</div><div class="cd">2 分钟 · 生效约 5 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>免疫并清掉多数自然毒与魔法。按固定毒点预留，顺手交时先确认距下个必留点不少于两分钟。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:1966}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">佯攻</div><div class="cd">15 秒充能（2 层）· 持续 6 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>范围 −40%、单体 −20%（配飘忽不定）。转好就按，兜住物理全团和斗篷之外的持续毒。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:5277}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">闪避</div><div class="cd">2 分钟 · 持续 10 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>配飘忽不定全伤 −20%。转好就叠在最疼的物理重击或流血上（尾王切骨者优先）。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:185311}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">猩红之瓶</div><div class="cd">30 秒 · 4 秒回 20%</div></div></div>
      <p>斗篷真空期扛持续掉血或高压连波时进场就喝，边吃边回别等治疗。</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="limit">
    <div class="h">暗影斗篷硬限制</div>
    <b>物理伤害挡不住</b>（鲜血献祭、振响、切骨者别交斗篷）；<b>仪式毒液和感染清不掉</b>（仪式毒液必须靠切骨者流血冲掉）；斗篷仅生效约 5 秒且冷却 2 分钟，顺手交牌前务必留足两分钟间隔。
  </div>

  <div class="kicks-box">
    <div class="kicks-head">
      <img class="ic" src="{{I:1766}}" alt="脚踢">
      <h3>全本必断读条</h3>
      <span>点击跳到对应战斗</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kicks">
      <a class="kick" href="#k-screech">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">01</span><span>原始毒蛇 · 开场小怪</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">刺耳嘶鸣</div>
        <div class="why">开场几波的第一打断目标，脚踢优先给它。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-envenom">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">02</span><span>高阶进化者 · 中后段小怪</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">毒伤</div>
        <div class="why">3 秒读条，漏断给队友挂 8 秒重毒；设焦点优先断。</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="timeline">
  <h2><span class="k">01</span>一场里斗篷交在哪</h2>
  <p class="sub">一场 +24 限时实录（展示真实冷却节奏，非每波强制照搬；具体取舍见下方路线）。</p>
  <div class="tl-card">
    <div class="tl-scroll">
{{TIMELINE}}
    </div>
    <div class="legend">
      <span><i class="pri"></i>核心斗篷点</span>
      <span><i class="e"></i>闪避 · 接切骨者</span>
      <span><i class="muted"></i>顺手斗篷</span>
      <span><i class="boss"></i>首领战</span>
      <span><i class="trash"></i>小怪段</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="route">
  <h2><span class="k">02</span>按路线逐段</h2>
  <p class="sub">看到什么 → 按什么 → 为什么。带「必做」标签的高亮行是每把必做的关键动作。</p>

  <div class="route">

    <!-- 开场 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s1">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>开场 → 拉维</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 仪式首领 / 双牙蹂躏者 / 原始毒蛇 / 贪婪的后裔</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>距拉维第一次三重喷吐至少还有两分钟时，才顺手交一次斗篷；治疗已驱散或快进拉维时直接留着。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1294569}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">麻痹射击</div><div class="s">双牙蹂躏者 · 魔法减速 14 秒</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷</span></div>
            <div class="why">毒和越叠越深的减速一起清；治疗能驱就让治疗驱，<b>消失也能解掉减速</b>（应急备选）。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1306550}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">鲜血献祭</div><div class="s">仪式首领读条 · 全团物理 · 吸收治疗</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条时开，吸收盾靠治疗刷掉。物理伤害，斗篷挡不住。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-screech">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1294557}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">刺耳嘶鸣</div><div class="s">原始毒蛇读条</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1766}}" alt="">脚踢</span></div>
            <div class="why">这几波的第一打断优先级。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1306890}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">不稳定的图腾</div><div class="s">仪式首领战斗中 · 地面范围</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:2983}}" alt="">疾跑</span><span class="or">或</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻</span></div>
            <div class="why">离开图腾范围；走不开就开佯攻，每跳少四成。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">建议：斗篷 0–1 次（距拉维 ≥ 2 分钟且未驱散时交）</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s2">下一段：拉维 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 1 拉维 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s2">
      <div class="node">1</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>拉维</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 1</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>斗篷好了就交给三重喷吐（战斗够长可交两次）；斗篷冷却中的毒球和每一次贪婪践踏都交佯攻。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1297876}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>三重喷吐</div><div class="s">毒球点名 · 10 秒持续自然毒</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷</span></div>
            <div class="why">驱散不掉，砸中后马上开（读条末预开也可直接免疫）；10 秒毒当场清掉，脚下不再烫自己和身边的人。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1297876}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">三重喷吐</div><div class="s">斗篷在冷却</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻</span></div>
            <div class="why">持续毒每跳几乎砍半。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1307894}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">贪婪践踏</div><div class="s">全团自然 · 约一分钟一次</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻</span></div>
            <div class="why">每次都开；不开要吃将近 90 万。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1296058}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">反刍</div><div class="s">点名直线胃酸波 · 减速且减伤害</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:36554}}" alt="">暗影步</span></div>
            <div class="why">走出直线（或暗影步贴回首领避开正面）；斗篷正好开着也能免疫。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">建议：斗篷 1–2 次 · 每次践踏交佯攻</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s3">下一段：进化者 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 进化者 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s3">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>拉维 → 扭缠盘蛇</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 高阶进化者 / 振响的扭缠蛇 / 放血者</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>脚踢盯紧高阶进化者的毒伤；漏断且距盘蛇第二次同步毒液还有两分钟以上才交斗篷，来不及就留给盘蛇、靠治疗驱散。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row" id="k-envenom">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1289416}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">毒伤</div><div class="s">高阶进化者 3 秒读条 · 8 秒中毒</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1766}}" alt="">脚踢</span></div>
            <div class="why">第一打断优先级，设焦点先踢；治疗也能驱。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1307571}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">毒伤（漏断上身）</div><div class="s">8 秒中毒 · 治疗未驱</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷</span></div>
            <div class="why">距盘蛇第二次同步毒液 ≥ 2 分钟时顺手清；否则开佯攻扛，把斗篷留给盘蛇。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1294859}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">振响</div><div class="s">全团物理 5 秒 · 无视护甲</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:5277}}" alt="">闪避</span></div>
            <div class="why">佯攻每跳少四成，闪避好了再叠。物理伤害，斗篷没用。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">建议：斗篷 0–1 次（仅距盘蛇第二次同步毒液 ≥ 2 分钟时交）</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s4">下一段：扭缠盘蛇 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 2 扭缠盘蛇 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s4">
      <div class="node">2</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>扭缠盘蛇</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 2</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>同步毒液约 90 秒一次。第一次开怪就来，斗篷没转好就开佯攻顶；<b>斗篷留给第二次</b>，别交在冲锋和撕裂上。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1299189}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>同步毒液 · 第二次</div><div class="s">全团 35 秒自然毒</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条时开，35 秒全团毒不上身；慢了半拍也照开，上身后一样能清掉。其余轮次靠治疗刷。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1299080}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">濒死喘息 / 解除盘卷</div><div class="s">被藤蔓连上每秒叠一层物理，直到撕裂</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1287798}}" alt="">藤蔓之握</span></div>
            <div class="why">被藤蔓连上 → <b>先开佯攻</b> → 按藤蔓之握（副本按钮）跑开 10 码扯开盘蛇；1–3 秒后全团炸解除盘卷，佯攻正好盖住。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1299130}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">掘地冲锋</div><div class="s">首领钻地冲走</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:36554}}" alt="">暗影步</span></div>
            <div class="why">冲锋落地后步回首领身边。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">建议：斗篷 1 次（留给第二次同步毒液）</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s5">下一段：利刃 · 神选者 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 神选者 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s5">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>扭缠盘蛇 → 祖尔加</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 祭坛利刃 / 晋升之蛇 / 高阶进化者 / 仪式首领 / 乌拉特克神选者 / 活体毒液</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm warn"><span class="lbl">高压段</span>神选者分两拨，剧毒涌动常和鲜血献祭叠在一起。<b>前面小怪别乱交斗篷</b>；神选者两拨按两次实际交牌时间算，间隔 ≥ 2 分钟可各交一次斗篷，任一次没转好都用佯攻 + 猩红之瓶顶。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1308518}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">淬毒之刃</div><div class="s">祭坛利刃闪到身后 · 4 秒自然毒</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:5277}}" alt="">闪避</span></div>
            <div class="why">这一段持续高压，斗篷不交；佯攻转好就开，闪避叠上能砍半。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1308865}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">感染 / 毒伤</div><div class="s">晋升之蛇种卵 5 秒炸 8 码 · 进化者毒伤同前</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻</span><span class="or">兜底</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷</span></div>
            <div class="why">感染斗篷清不掉，常规留斗篷给神选者；<b>结束前离开队友 8 码，爆出幼体马上转火打掉</b>（仅距第一拨神选者 ≥ 2 分钟且血线危急时，可兜底用斗篷挡跳伤）。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1306852}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>剧毒涌动</div><div class="s">乌拉特克神选者 2 秒读条 · 9 秒全团毒风暴</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷</span><span class="or">/</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻</span></div>
            <div class="why">每次涌动看当前冷却：斗篷转好直接开（生效约 5 秒，期间跳伤和毒液爆裂全免，结束还在掉血接佯攻）；未转好就全程佯攻，血线低喝猩红之瓶。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1306550}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">鲜血献祭</div><div class="s">常和剧毒涌动叠在一起（同前段，物理吸收盾）</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:185311}}" alt="">猩红之瓶</span></div>
            <div class="why">斗篷挡毒，佯攻挡献祭，血线低就喝瓶。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">建议：斗篷 1–2 次（按两次实际交牌时间算，间隔 ≥ 2 分钟交 2 次；未转好时靠佯攻 + 猩红之瓶顶）</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s6">下一段：祖尔加 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 3 祖尔加 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s6">
      <div class="node">3</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>祖尔加</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 3</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>毒牙仪式约 <b>65 秒</b>一轮（5 秒读条后出 8 秒蛇头光束），贼很适合拦光束。拦完身上的<b>仪式毒液</b>按减益倒计时喷发（首次上身约 57 秒、末次刷新后约 50 秒），必须靠切骨者 7 秒流血冲掉。斗篷和闪避均为 2 分钟冷却，隔轮（约 130 秒）各转好一次。</div>
        <div class="subhead">一轮毒牙仪式（以毒牙仪式开始读条为 0 秒）</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">0 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300885}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">毒牙仪式（开始读条）</div><div class="s">5 秒读条 → 约 +5 秒光束生效</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">提前就位光束路径</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条期间不掉血，别提前把斗篷按空；就位等光束射出。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">约 +5 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300885}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">拦截光束</div><div class="s">光束持续 8 秒 · 自然伤害</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">斗篷</span><span class="or">或</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:185311}}" alt="">猩红之瓶</span></div>
            <div class="why"><b>站进光束后再开斗篷</b>（只盖住约 5 秒，前后露出的几跳开佯攻）；斗篷没好就开佯攻并立刻喝瓶，别等治疗。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">+32 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1301508}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>切骨者（开始读条）</div><div class="s">5 秒读条 → 命中后 7 秒无视护甲流血</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:5277}}" alt="">闪避（有就叠）</span></div>
            <div class="why">身上有仪式毒液就站进飞斧路径，<b>读条结束前开好佯攻，闪避转好就一起叠</b>（隔轮约 130 秒转好，配飘忽不定全伤 −20% 盖住首击和流血）。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+44 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><div><div class="n">流血结束</div><div class="s">命中后 7 秒，仪式毒液跟着消失</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"></div>
            <div class="why">确认毒液清除，不会喷发，本轮结束。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">没接到</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300894}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">+48 秒第二把飞斧 / 兜底顶喷发</div><div class="s">5 秒读条最后接斧；两把全漏看减益倒计时</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻接斧</span><span class="or">/</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">斗篷顶喷发</span></div>
            <div class="why">第二把切骨者开佯攻还能再接一次。两把全漏且斗篷转好，就<b>盯仪式毒液倒计时，最后 1–2 秒开斗篷</b>抵抗喷发（同一轮<b>用过斗篷拦光束</b>就转不好；用佯攻和瓶子拦光束仍可留斗篷兜底；用斗篷顶喷发后，后续两轮拦光束改用佯攻 + 瓶子）。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">拦光束时每一跳吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">29.4 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>佯攻</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:78%">22.9 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>暗影斗篷</span><div class="bar"><span class="zero">0 · 免疫</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">建议：斗篷隔轮交光束</span><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:5277}}" alt="">切骨者每轮交佯攻，闪避隔轮叠</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#talent">查看天赋 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="talent">
  <h2><span class="k">03</span>天赋</h2>
  <p class="sub">取自 +24 限时录像的敏锐天赋，英雄天赋欺诈者。复制字符串，在游戏天赋界面点「导入」。</p>
  <div class="talent">
    <div class="code-row">
      <code id="talent-code">{{TALENT}}</code>
      <button type="button" id="copy-btn">复制</button>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-label">这四个防御天赋不要动</p>
    <div class="tal-grid">
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:79008}}" alt=""><div><b>飘忽不定</b><span>闪避期间所有伤害 −20%；佯攻对非范围伤害也 −20%。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:423647}}" alt=""><div><b>优雅诡谋</b><span>佯攻 2 层充能，践踏、献祭和切骨者都赶得上。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1267220}}" alt=""><div><b>危险感知</b><span>20% 几率让一次伤害降低 20%。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:231719}}" alt=""><div><b>麻木神经</b><span>受到的物理伤害 −5%，切骨者和鲜血献祭都吃到。</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-note">常见可换：<b>吸血药膏、轻若鸿毛、恶毒药膏</b> ↔ <b>剧毒短匕、铜肠铁胃、强化致伤药膏</b>；另配有强化疾跑与欺诈者「烟雾」。</p>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>潜行者 · 毒牙祭坛 应对手册 · 2026-11</div>
    <div class="refs">参考录像：
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/1AWhVvdLbpy2gPak#fight=36">斗篷小王子 +24 29:40</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/pJqfFgYPNKaBmz1k#fight=30">黑川茜贼贼 +24 29:47</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/vyTYACGBPHca6qtw#fight=4">Qingxinlucky +24 29:49</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/x31kmyYL2fMKCw6T#fight=18">Dlkeyrogue +23 28:12</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/yp8drqxAtz7F4KC9#fight=18">Charrend +23 28:37</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
(function(){
  var btn=document.getElementById("copy-btn"), code=document.getElementById("talent-code");
  if(btn&&code){
    btn.addEventListener("click",function(){
      var t=code.textContent.trim();
      function done(){btn.textContent="已复制";setTimeout(function(){btn.textContent="复制";},1600);}
      function fallback(){var r=document.createRange();r.selectNodeContents(code);var sel=window.getSelection();sel.removeAllRanges();sel.addRange(r);try{document.execCommand("copy");done();}catch(e){btn.textContent="已选中，按 Ctrl+C";}}
      if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(t).then(done,fallback);}else{fallback();}
    });
  }

  var links={};
  document.querySelectorAll(".nav a[href^='#']").forEach(function(a){links[a.getAttribute("href").slice(1)]=a;});
  var targets=Object.keys(links).map(function(id){return document.getElementById(id);}).filter(Boolean);
  function spy(){
    var y=window.scrollY+110, cur=targets[0]?targets[0].id:null;
    targets.forEach(function(el){if(el.getBoundingClientRect().top+window.scrollY<=y) cur=el.id;});
    if(targets.length&&window.innerHeight+window.scrollY>=document.documentElement.scrollHeight-4) cur=targets[targets.length-1].id;
    Object.keys(links).forEach(function(id){links[id].classList.toggle("on",id===cur);});
  }
  window.addEventListener("scroll",spy,{passive:true}); spy();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
